@startuml get-manager-dashboard-member
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/member
caption CRB-92 · 어드민 홈 대시보드 — 회원 현황. 읽기 전용, 기존 테이블만 집계 (신규 테이블 · 컬럼 없음). 개인정보를 내려주지 않아 access-log는 남기지 않음. 탈퇴한 회원(is_deleted)은 집계에서 제외 (커피챗 요청 이력은 탈퇴와 무관하게 그대로 셈)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerDashboardController" as Controller
participant "ManagerDashboardService" as Service
participant "AdminDashboardRepository" as Repository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/member?range=30d\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과 (admin · superadmin 모두 조회 가능)
alt range 검증 실패 (7d · 30d · 90d 중 하나, 생략하면 30d)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getMember(query)
Controller -> Service: getMember(range)
note right of Service
  range는 신규 가입에만 적용. 가입자 수 · 활성 사용자 · 탈퇴 유예는 현재 시점 기준
end note
Service -> Repository: memberStats(from = now - range)
par 동시에 조회
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT type, status, count(*)\nFROM users WHERE is_deleted = false GROUP BY type, status
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 유형별 신규 가입: count(*) WHERE status = 'active' AND created_at >= from
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 유형별 활성 사용자: count(*) WHERE last_active_at >= now - 7 days / now - 30 days
else
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: 탈퇴 유예 중: count(*) WHERE withdraw_requested_at IS NOT NULL
end
PostgreSQL --> Repository: 집계 결과
Repository --> Service: 원시 집계값
Service --> Controller: ManagerDashboardMemberDto
Controller --> Client: 200 {\n  range, generated_at,\n  student: { active, pending, new, active_7d, active_30d },\n  graduated: { active, pending, new, active_7d, active_30d },\n  withdraw_pending\n}

@enduml
